    "handoff": "Install https://github.com/letya999/txttsql-mcp as the reviewed read-only SQL engine. In the protected Broker form paste the sources JSON pointing each source at its managed forward (127.0.0.1:15432/15433/15434) and give the real host:port endpoints; database names, schemas and roles stay inside the sources JSON, not tool arguments. Verify list_sources, then do not change provider data without an explicit instruction."
  },
